meta {
  name: Download Visual Design Image
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/visual-designs/:id/download
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:path {
  id: {{designId}}
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Download Visual Design Image
  Fetches the visual design image (`generated_image_url`, falling back to `original_image_url`) from Supabase Storage—enforcing `supabase.co` hostname validation, disabling redirects, and applying a 15-second timeout—converts it to PNG via `sharp`, and returns it as a downloadable attachment (`latvanyterv-<id>.png`).

  ### Authentication
  - **Bearer Token** required (`Authorization: Bearer <token>`).

  ### Path Parameters
  - `id` (string | number, required): Unique identifier of the visual design owned by the authenticated user.

  ### Responses
  - `200 OK`: Binary PNG file (`Content-Type: image/png`, `Content-Disposition: attachment`).
  - `401 Unauthorized`: Missing or invalid JWT token.
  - `403 Forbidden`: Image URL hostname is outside `supabase.co` (`{ "message": "Biztonsági okokból a letöltés megtagadva: érvénytelen forrás." }`).
  - `404 Not Found`: Visual design not found (`{ "message": "A látványterv nem található." }`) or no downloadable image URL exists (`{ "message": "Nincs letölthető kép ehhez a látványtervhez." }`).
  - `500 Internal Server Error`: Failed to fetch or convert the image (`{ "message": "Hiba történt a kép letöltése során." }`).
}